## Conclusion

P8 improves the scientific picture but does not yet deliver an end-to-end case-balanced win. The separate P7B profitability traversal was removed successfully: the frozen gate itself is close to useful once telemetry already exists. The remaining dominant cost is now the Python bookkeeping needed to accumulate the full telemetry feature set during source-DAG construction.
